{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17678","headline":"秋夜闲居即事寄庐山郑员外蜀郡符处士 · 杨巨源","name":"秋夜闲居即事寄庐山郑员外蜀郡符处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忧思繁未整，良辰会无由。\n引领迟佳音，星纪屡以周。\n蓬阆绝华耀，况乃处穷愁。\n坠叶寒拥砌，灯火夜悠悠。\n开琴弄清弦，窥月俯澄流。\n冉冉鸿鴈度，萧萧帷箔秋。\n怅怀石门咏，缅慕碧鸡游。\n髣髴蒙颜色，崇兰隐芳洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17678.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17678","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}